      nullReasons: {
        cardValues: 'Primary sources for Bullshit describe only that players race to empty their hands rather than using rank-based scoring. When tables keep running tallies across deals, a simple and common convention is to count each remaining card as one penalty point regardless of rank, which this JSON encodes.',
